'''Terun''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] and [[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]] gains the [[Strong Against]] ability. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

